      <h2>This is not a government website</h2>
      <div class="warn"><strong>eDistrict UP Seva is an independent, privately run information website.</strong> It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to the Government of Uttar Pradesh, the eDistrict project, the National Informatics Centre (NIC), the eSathi portal or CSC e-Governance Services India Ltd. The only official portal of the Government of Uttar Pradesh for these services is <strong>edistrict.up.gov.in</strong>.</div>
      <p>The purpose of this website is purely educational and informational — to explain government service procedures in simple language. Nothing published here is a substitute for an official notification, order or circular.</p>

      <h3>Accuracy of information</h3>
      <p>We research every guide against official sources and make every effort to update it when rules change. However, fees, eligibility criteria, document lists and procedures can change without prior notice. Therefore, <strong>before applying, always verify the relevant fee and rules once on the official portal, edistrict.up.gov.in</strong>. If there is any difference between a guide on this website and the official portal, the information on the official portal prevails.</p>

      <h3>Your login details belong to you alone</h3>
      <p>We never ask for your <strong>eSathi login ID, password, OTP or any Aadhaar-linked information</strong> — not on this website and not by email. Never share these details with anyone. Enter your login credentials only on the official portal, esathi.up.gov.in, and check the address (URL) carefully before proceeding.</p>

      <h3>Trademarks and names</h3>
      <p>All names and marks used on this website — such as eDistrict, eSathi, CSC and DigiLocker — belong to their respective owners. They are mentioned only for identification and information purposes, and their use does not imply any affiliation or endorsement.</p>

      <h3>Limitation of liability</h3>
